[[2047,15,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch for the reversing lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied when the ignition is switched on (INT) by the line for\nfuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>When reverse gear is engaged, the switch\ncloses and sends the supply to the reversing lights in the centre\nrear light cluster on the left \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and on the right \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F36</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nvia the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 9 connector D and pins 6 and\n7 of connector G).</p>"],[16,15,1130496,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>Reversing light switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is not\npresent.</p><p>Pins 8 and 9 of the automatic transmission\nsolenoids unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , connector A, are connected to the reverse\ngear sensor and send the signals for switching on the reversing\nlight in the same way as for other versions.</p>"]]